OL,5,G1700 Roy Noble
OL,6,     FActor Tim Downie, known for
OL,7,     FOutlander and Paddington, explores
OL,8,     Fancient customs from wassailing to
OL,9,     Fthe Mari Lwyd. Plus, award-winning
OL,10,     FWelsh poet Georgia Griffiths joins
OL,11,     FRoy.
OL,12,G1900 Keepers of Tomorrow: Wales's Green
OL,13,G     Guardians
OL,14,     FWe explore the role of the adults
OL,15,     Fwho dedicate time to environmental
OL,16,     Fgroups and initiatives. We uncover
OL,17,     Ftheir motivations, the challenges,
OL,18,     Fand the satisfaction from
OL,19,     Finspiring.
OL,20,G1929 Celebration (Evening Edition)
OL,21,     FRebecca Thomas leads a service for
OL,22,     FReformation Sunday.
